      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just a small comment on a feature that could be added to that, is the ability to also measure the distance between the player with said transform.\nBasicaly, if you only select a single transform, the value becomes the distance between You and said transform, adding interactivity with other players, playing animations when you touch someone for exemple (Slap!)",
